---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import TipLineForm from '../components/TipLineForm.astro';
---
<PageLayout title="Tip line" description="Tell mm!ke what you've seen, heard, or built. The tip line is open.">

  <p>If you are building something in legal AI, or if you have spotted something I should know about, this is where to tell me.</p>

  <p>I read every submission. I do not promise to cover every submission. I apply the same editorial standards to tips as I do to everything else: if I cannot verify it, I will not publish it as fact. If it looks like it was submitted to damage a competitor, it will not run.</p>

  <p>Your contact details, if you provide them, are used only for editorial follow-up. I do not share tip line submissions with third parties.</p>

  <TipLineForm />

</PageLayout>
